1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Air quality affects how we live, travel, and spend time outdoors.

2
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:15,000
But environmental readings alone do not always tell us what they mean or how we should respond. AeroSense AI brings air-quality intelligence, data, and AI interpretation together.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,500
AeroSense AI provides a centralized view of available air-quality information.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Users can understand pollution levels, inspect pollutant readings, and examine monitoring data available for their selected location.

5
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:41,000
The platform makes data sources, timestamps, and WHO guideline ratios visible, helping users understand data freshness and reliability.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:51,500
With the interactive global map, users can explore available monitoring stations geographically.

7
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:06,500
Selecting a physical ground station reveals verified readings, coordinates, and observation freshness, making it easy to understand spatial pollution patterns.

8
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Beyond current readings, AeroSense AI helps users explore environmental trends.

9
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:25,500
Its analytics observatory provides continuous historical and forecast trajectories with deterministic surge detection,

10
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:33,000
while city comparison tools enable side-by-side benchmarking across global metropolitan areas.

11
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:42,500
The integrated Gemini-powered assistant adds contextual environmental intelligence.

12
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:51,500
Instead of simply displaying raw numbers, it interprets atmospheric conditions and delivers actionable activity guidance.

13
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:02,500
Every statement is strictly grounded in real telemetry retrieved through backend function calling, with zero hallucinated figures.

14
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:11,500
Additional capabilities turn environmental data into practical insights.

15
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Users can consult evidence-based activity guidance, configure threshold-based pollution alerts, and access compliance reports,

16
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:27,000
and seamlessly toggle between scientific light and dark workstation themes.

17
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:36,500
AeroSense AI transforms complex environmental data into understandable atmospheric intelligence.

18
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:44,500
By combining physical ground monitoring with grounded AI interpretation, it empowers people to make better decisions about the air they breathe.
